&lt;p&gt;This report documents the penetration testing activities performed against the &lt;strong&gt;HackTheBox Support&lt;/strong&gt; machine. The objective was to conduct a thorough security assessment simulating a real-world internal penetration test, identifying vulnerabilities, exploiting them, and documenting the full attack chain from initial access to complete domain compromise.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>TwoMillion</title><link>https://justgr0w.github.io/writeups/twomillion/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://justgr0w.github.io/writeups/twomillion/</guid><description>API REST de una plataforma de_CTF donde un endpoint PUT sin autenticación permite escalada a administrador. Con admin se genera un VPN config que ejecuta código, y el privesc a root usa OverlayFS (CVE-2023-0386).</description></item><item><title>Dog</title><link>https://justgr0w.github.io/writeups/dog/</link><pubDate>Sat, 14 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://justgr0w.github.io/writeups/dog/</guid><description>Backdrop CMS con el directorio .git expuesto: las credenciales de MySQL en settings.php y un usuario del panel permiten subir un módulo con reverse shell. El privesc viene de un SUID en el binario bee.</description></item><item><title>Nocturnal</title><link>https://justgr0w.github.io/writeups/nocturnal/</link><pubDate>Sat, 31 May 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://justgr0w.github.io/writeups/nocturnal/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;Nocturnal â€” Intrusion Completa
